    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{7!}{2!3!}=420$",
      "worked": "There are seven letters, with two identical A’s and three identical G’s.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\frac{7!}{2!3!}\\\\N&=420\\end{align*}$$",
